        <li><strong>Address:</strong> Avinguda Alfonso Puchades, 22, bajo, 03501 Benidorm (Alicante), Spain</li>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:Arangodentalclinic@gmail.com">Arangodentalclinic@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+34965088282">+34 965 08 82 82</a></li>
        <li><strong>Activity:</strong> private dental clinic</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Purpose</h2>
      <p>
        This legal notice governs the use of the website arangodentalclinic.es (hereinafter, "the Website"), owned
        by Arango Dental Clinic. Browsing the Website gives you the status of user and implies full acceptance of
        the conditions set out in this Legal Notice.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Conditions of access and use</h2>
      <p>
        Access to the Website is free of charge, except for the cost of the connection through the
        telecommunications network. The user agrees to make proper and lawful use of the Website and of its
        content and services, in accordance with current legislation, good faith and public order. Use of the
        Website for unlawful or harmful purposes, or in any way that may cause damage or prevent its normal
        operation, is prohibited.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Intellectual and industrial property</h2>
      <p>
        All content on the Website (texts, photographs, graphics, images, logos, design, structure and source
        code) is owned by Arango Dental Clinic or by third parties who have authorised its use, and is protected
        by intellectual and industrial property law. Its reproduction, distribution, public communication or
        transformation, in whole or in part, without the express authorisation of the owner is prohibited.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Exclusion of liability</h2>
      <p>
        Arango Dental Clinic does not guarantee the availability, continuity or error-free operation of the
        Website, and accepts no liability for any damage that may result from its unavailability or lack of
        continuity, nor for damage caused by viruses, technical faults or interference beyond its control.
      </p>
      <p>
        The informational content and treatment descriptions on the Website are for general information only and
        in no case replace an in-person professional consultation, diagnosis or assessment. Nothing on the
        Website should be read as individual medical advice.
      </p>
      <p>
        Links to third-party websites included on this Website are provided for information only. Arango Dental
        Clinic is not responsible for the content of those sites or for any consequences of accessing them.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Applicable law and jurisdiction</h2>
      <p>
        These conditions are governed by Spanish law. For the resolution of any dispute arising from access to or
        use of the Website, the parties submit to the courts of the user's place of residence, unless the
        applicable regulations provide otherwise.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        Arango Dental Clinic reserves the right to modify this Legal Notice at any time to adapt it to legislative
        developments or changes to the Website. We recommend that you review it periodically.
      </p>

      <p class="lgl-updated">Last updated: 22 August 2026</p>

